OL,3,AAnthropic becomes one of world's most
OL,4,Avaluable public companies in stock
OL,5,Amarket debut
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnthropic has become one of the most
OL,8,Fvaluable public companies in the world
OL,9,Fafter its shares began trading on the
OL,10,Fstock market, taking its valuation to
OL,11,Froughly $1.76 trillion (#1.34
OL,12,Ftrillion).
OL,14,FThe artificial intelligence (AI)
OL,15,Fcompany's Thursday debut on the Nasdaq
OL,16,Fstock exchange was a crucial test for
OL,17,Fthe industry, given the huge amount of
OL,18,Fmoney being poured into advancing the
OL,19,Ftechnology.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,109,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11908
SC,0008
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1795159463
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AAnthropic becomes one of world's most
OL,4,Avaluable public companies in stock
OL,5,Amarket debut
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnthropic's shares flew past its
OL,8,Fallocation price of $83 each, showing
OL,9,Fthere was plenty of excitement around
OL,10,FAI.
OL,12,FYet the company, which is behind AI
OL,13,Fchatbot Claude, will remain under
OL,14,Fintense scrutiny in the months ahead to
OL,15,Fanswer the key question surrounding AI:
OL,16,Fis it all worth it?
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
